---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Notions - Soft Goods - DES4800"
  description="Needles, zippers, fasteners, and other notions for soft-goods making."
>
  <article class="post-detail">
    <header class="post-header">
      <a href="/soft-goods/" class="back-link">← Back to Soft Goods</a>
      <h1>Notions</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <p>
        Notions are the small components that finish and reinforce soft goods—needles, zippers, snaps, elastic, labels,
        and more. Choosing them with the same care as fabric and thread keeps prototypes wearable, repairable, and clear
        in intent. This page will expand with commonly used studio notions and how to specify them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
